        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-23T15:10:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had to be away from Indianapolis Fri, Sat, and Sun, but caught up with Christopher and Russ (Rabit) about how things went while I was gone.</p>\n<p>Sounds like the Fri event was a bit of a bust but all the others went well and many of them were really excellent. I hear the crowd up in Lafayette was particularly enthusiastic and that the crowd at Gamerz, who were mostly there to play Werewolf, took to the games in ones and twos as people gave it a chance and then started raving about it to the others.</p>",
